        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/8ee6a333f6ddffd458377c0584e90504.avif?t=1769443237\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Monkey Clicker</strong> is a clicker game inspired by the Infinite Monkey Theorem. The idea that an infinite number of monkeys typing on typewriters could eventually write any text, even the greatest works of literature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you manage your very own forest office of hardworking monkeys. Your goal is simple: guide your team from typing random letters to creating full words, sentences and eventually entire books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/9ec977639ca10298c596fe121878d78e.webp?t=1769443237\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/9ec977639ca10298c596fe121878d78e.poster.avif?t=1769443237\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and expand your operation by hiring more skilled monkeys and improving their tools. Watch your typewriters clack endlessly as your monkeys strive to produce meaning from madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/eb638f2fad5f97cfc40a6d8b42ea17b6.poster.avif?t=1769443237\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/eb638f2fad5f97cfc40a6d8b42ea17b6.webm?t=1769443237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on your own typewriter to speed up progress and enjoy the oddly relaxing rhythm of infinite typing. Will your team of monkeys manage to write a masterpiece or just an endless stream of nonsense?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/8ee6a333f6ddffd458377c0584e90504.avif?t=1769443237\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Monkey Clicker</strong> is a clicker game inspired by the Infinite Monkey Theorem. The idea that an infinite number of monkeys typing on typewriters could eventually write any text, even the greatest works of literature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you manage your very own forest office of hardworking monkeys. Your goal is simple: guide your team from typing random letters to creating full words, sentences and eventually entire books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/9ec977639ca10298c596fe121878d78e.webp?t=1769443237\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/9ec977639ca10298c596fe121878d78e.poster.avif?t=1769443237\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and expand your operation by hiring more skilled monkeys and improving their tools. Watch your typewriters clack endlessly as your monkeys strive to produce meaning from madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/eb638f2fad5f97cfc40a6d8b42ea17b6.poster.avif?t=1769443237\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139830/extras/eb638f2fad5f97cfc40a6d8b42ea17b6.webm?t=1769443237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on your own typewriter to speed up progress and enjoy the oddly relaxing rhythm of infinite typing. Will your team of monkeys manage to write a masterpiece or just an endless stream of nonsense?</p>",
        "short_description": "Infinite Monkey Clicker is a clicker game inspired by the Infinite Monkey Theorem. Hire new monkeys typing nonstop on typewriters to generate letters and words and see if they can finally write Hamlet!",
